  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "MoClo Golden Gate \u2014 red fluorescent transcription unit"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aim \u2014 assemble a Level 1 transcription unit that expresses a red fluorescent protein by a one-pot BsaI Golden Gate reaction (CIDAR MoClo), combining four Level-0 parts \u2014 "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-525cf33d",
              "label": "J23106",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-525cf33d",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/J23106_AB"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "label": "B0034m",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0034m_BC"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-694681f1",
              "label": "E1010m (mRFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-694681f1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E1010m_CD"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-5427ea3f",
              "label": "B0015",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-5427ea3f",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0015_DE"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-84ad4efb",
              "label": "DVA_AE",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-84ad4efb",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/DVA_AE"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " \u2014 into the destination vector. Fusion-site overhangs order the parts scarlessly; the vector's lacZ\u03b1 dropout plus mRFP give a two-colour screen."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The five parts"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Every part is a real sequence file in this workspace \u2014 click a chip to open it in the sequence viewer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "mention",
                    "attrs": {
                      "id": "sample-525cf33d",
                      "label": "J23106",
                      "entityType": "sequence",
                      "entityId": "sample-525cf33d",
                      "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/J23106_AB"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " \u2014 constitutive promoter (Anderson family), fusion sites A\u2192B."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "mention",
                    "attrs": {
                      "id": "sample-7981ffa1",
                      "label": "B0034m",
                      "entityType": "sequence",
                      "entityId": "sample-7981ffa1",
                      "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0034m_BC"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " \u2014 strong ribosome-binding site (Weiss), B\u2192C."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "mention",
                    "attrs": {
                      "id": "sample-694681f1",
                      "label": "E1010m (mRFP)",
                      "entityType": "sequence",
                      "entityId": "sample-694681f1",
                      "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E1010m_CD"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " \u2014 red-fluorescent CDS (monomeric DsRed derivative), C\u2192D."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "mention",
                    "attrs": {
                      "id": "sample-5427ea3f",
                      "label": "B0015",
                      "entityType": "sequence",
                      "entityId": "sample-5427ea3f",
                      "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0015_DE"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " \u2014 double transcription terminator (B0010:B0012), D\u2192E."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "mention",
                    "attrs": {
                      "id": "sample-84ad4efb",
                      "label": "DVA_AE",
                      "entityType": "sequence",
                      "entityId": "sample-84ad4efb",
                      "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/DVA_AE"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " \u2014 Level 1 destination vector: lacZ\u03b1 dropout + AmpR, accepts A\u2026E."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The protein we're expressing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "embed",
        "attrs": {
          "type": "structure3d",
          "refId": "structure3d-2h5q",
          "data": {
            "id": "structure3d-2h5q",
            "source": "pdb",
            "sourceId": "2H5Q",
            "pdbId": "2H5Q",
            "label": "mCherry (mFruit derived from the mRFP1 lineage)"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-694681f1",
              "label": "E1010m (mRFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-694681f1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E1010m_CD"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is mRFP1 (a monomeric derivative of DsRed, Campbell et al. 2002). Shown is mCherry (PDB 2H5Q, 1.36 \u00c5) \u2014 the widely-used optimised descendant of the same DsRed\u2192mRFP1 lineage: an 11-stranded \u03b2-barrel enclosing the autocatalytic Met-Tyr-Gly chromophore."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The MoClo idea"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Level 0 (basic parts: promoter, RBS, CDS, terminator)  \u2192  Golden Gate  \u2192  Level 1 (one transcription unit)  \u2192  Golden Gate  \u2192  Level 2 (multigene)."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Each Level-0 part is pre-domesticated (internal BsaI sites removed) and flanked by BsaI sites that release a 4-bp fusion overhang. The overhangs run A-B-C-D-E, so parts can only assemble in one order:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "embed",
        "attrs": {
          "type": "table",
          "refId": "gg-fusion-map",
          "data": {
            "id": "gg-fusion-map",
            "name": "Fusion-site grammar (CIDAR)",
            "rows": 6,
            "cols": 4,
            "cells": [
              [
                {
                  "value": "Part",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "Left site",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "Right site",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "Junction it defines",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "value": "Promoter (J23106)",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "vector \u2192 promoter | promoter \u2192 RBS",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "value": "RBS (B0034m)",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "promoter \u2192 RBS | RBS \u2192 CDS (ATG)",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "value": "CDS (E1010m)",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "D",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "RBS \u2192 CDS | CDS \u2192 terminator",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "value": "Terminator (B0015)",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "D",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "E",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "CDS \u2192 terminator | terminator \u2192 vector",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "value": "Destination (DVA_AE)",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "E",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "accepts the whole A\u2192E unit; drops lacZ\u03b1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Golden Gate reaction"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Enter each miniprep's "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "yield",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (ng/\u00b5L); the table computes fmol/\u00b5L from the fragment size, the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "equimolar \u00b5L to add",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for the target fmol, and the master-mix volume. Set the master-mix multiplier to your number of reactions \u00d7 1.1 (e.g. 4 reactions \u2192 4.4\u00d7); every master-mix column scales by it."
          }
        ]
      },
