      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The \u00d71.1 multiplier makes ~10% extra (here 0.4 reaction's worth) as master-mix leftover, covering pipetting loss. If any part's \u00b5L/rxn is below ~0.5 \u00b5L, dilute that miniprep so it's pipettable."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thermocycler \u2014 one-pot cycled digestion-ligation:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "codeBlock",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "[ 37 \u00b0C 1 min \u2192 16 \u00b0C 1 min ] \u00d7 30\n37 \u00b0C  5 min   (final digest)\n80 \u00b0C 10 min   (heat-kill)\n 4 \u00b0C  hold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Transformation & screening"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "taskList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "taskItem",
            "attrs": {
              "checked": false
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Transform 2 \u00b5L of the reaction into 50 \u00b5L chemically-competent DH5\u03b1 (heat-shock 42 \u00b0C, 30 s)."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "taskItem",
            "attrs": {
              "checked": false
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Recover in 250 \u00b5L SOC, 37 \u00b0C, 1 h, shaking."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "taskItem",
            "attrs": {
              "checked": false
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Plate on LB + ampicillin (100 \u00b5g/mL) + X-gal + IPTG."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "taskItem",
            "attrs": {
              "checked": false
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Incubate 37 \u00b0C overnight, then 4 \u00b0C for colour to develop."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Read-out: "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "white",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " colonies = lacZ\u03b1 replaced by the transcription unit (assembled); "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "blue",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " = empty/re-ligated vector. Correct white colonies are also "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "red/pink",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " \u2014 mRFP is expressed from J23106."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Colony screening"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
